Package: rtailcat
Title: Peer-to-Peer Network Connections with 'tailcat'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Colin", "Rundel", , "cr173@duke.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Tailscale Inc & contributors", role = "cph",
           comment = "Author and copyright holder of the bundled, statically linked 'tailcat' Go library; see inst/COPYRIGHTS")
  )
Description: Embeds the 'tailcat' Go library <https://github.com/tailscale/tailcat> through its C ABI, providing both the server and client side of 'tailcat' connections from R. TCP streams and UDP datagrams are exchanged between peers through public relays without accounts, using a shareable secret address.
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
URL: https://rundel.github.io/rtailcat/, https://github.com/rundel/rtailcat, https://github.com/tailscale/tailcat
BugReports: https://github.com/rundel/rtailcat/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
